  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993530f8b21843548a82c04346b03b59, type: 3}
  m_Name: averagechatmessagePool
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ChatMessage
  modeName: chat
  delayRange: {x: 0.5, y: 2}
  messages:
  - messageText: "I swear he\u2019s just vibing with the terrain."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "This man\u2019s got the navigation skills of a GPS with attitude."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the stride of someone who forgot the objective."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s exploring like he\u2019s auditioning for a travel vlog."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s trying to unlock a secret door with vibes."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the map memorized... or not."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: This is the slow burn of greatness.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s walking like he\u2019s narrating a nature documentary."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s taking the long way for dramatic effect."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s walking like the floor might betray him."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I\u2019m here for the scenic route and the chaos."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s taking the scenic route to assert dominance."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That was a bold move for no reason.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s speedrunning like he\u2019s late for dinner."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s roleplaying as a confused NPC."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I swear he\u2019s taking the scenic route on purpose."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s trying to unlock achievements by accident."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I swear he\u2019s just trying to confuse the viewers."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s walking like he\u2019s avoiding responsibilities."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the stride of a confused tourist."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "This is the most dramatic hallway I\u2019ve ever seen."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: I think he just walked past the objective... again.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I swear he\u2019s just trying to make the level last longer."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That detour was sponsored by curiosity.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: Is he lost or just sightseeing?
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s moving like he\u2019s narrating his own journey."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the pathfinding skills of a squirrel in a maze."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s moving like he\u2019s avoiding eye contact with the level."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That corner looked suspicious... and he still walked into it.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the stealth of a marching band."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That wall definitely looked climbable... nope.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That jump was a leap of faith and a prayer.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: This is peak wandering energy.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s checking every corner like it owes him money."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s got the agility of a caffeinated cat."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That jump was way too close for comfort.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s walking like he\u2019s in a fashion show."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I\u2019m convinced he\u2019s mapping the level for science."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: 'Parkour level: mildly impressive.'
    weight: 10
  - messageText: This is what peak wandering looks like.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: This is peak exploration content.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: That was a jump scare from a rock.
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s trying to confuse the map."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s moving like he\u2019s dodging invisible enemies."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s trying to unlock lore by walking weird."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s exploring like he\u2019s looking for snacks."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "I think he\u2019s trying to break the game physics."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s moving like he\u2019s trying to avoid spoilers."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "This is the most intense walking simulator I\u2019ve ever seen."
    weight: 10
  - messageText: "He\u2019s walking like the floor is lava... emotionally."
    weight: 10
